	(text_box "The LTC4365 is configured using an external resistor divider sized according to the manufacturer's recommended topology, providing defined undervoltage and overvoltage thresholds at 2.5 V and 5.0 V respectively. The divider values are calculated assuming an allowable UV pin offset of VOS(UV) = 3 mV, in order to minimize threshold errors due to leakage currents.\nAdditional input protection is implemented using a resettable PTC fuse (1206L035YR) to limit fault current, and a bidirectional TVS diode (SMAJ15CA) to protect against ESD and transient overvoltage events on the input supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 100.33 0)
		(size 38.1 54.61)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
